        "text": "Today, I’m publishing a memo I sent to the @scale_AI team earlier this year:\n\nActive vs. Lazy Thinking, or How to not suck when you get big.\n\nThread below for a few key ideas 👇\n\nhttps://t.co/tHkgrKD1sm"
